ences Employing Galvanized Steel Tubular Pickets</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM F2814</RID><RTL>(2009; R 2015) Standard Guide for Design and Construction of Ornamental Steel Picket Fence Systems for Security Purposes</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Review submittal description (SD) definitions in Section <SRF>01 33 00</SRF> SUBMITTAL 
